#	Origin: EmberBSD (Linux 6.18 i915 driver).  Own file list; the names are those of the files imported into dist618.
#
# DRAFT of the file list of the i915 driver of Linux 6.18 (dist618/drm/i915) for config(1):
# the 271 sources of the working set for Arrow Lake 8086:7d67 after the files that the chosen
# Kconfig options and the reasons at the end leave out.  Not included from sys/conf/files and not
# used by any module or kernel configuration: the driver has no autoconfiguration glue and does not link.
#
# The first block compiles against the layer (clang -c, the flags of the drmkms618 module with -Werror and
# the waivers of the virtiogpu618 module, plus -Wno-initializer-overrides for the i915 module as the
# driver's own build has it); the second does not yet, the reason is the first compiler error.
# Counts are in drm618/README.
#
# Regenerate it by compiling every file of the set when the layer grows.

